WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.360
Are you married?

2
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.730
No, I'm not.

3
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.160
I'm still single.

4
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.460
How about you?

5
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.700
I'm single too!

6
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.200
Do you have any siblings?

7
00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.060
Yes, I have one brother and one sister.

8
00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.300
What about you?

9
00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:37.000
I have two sisters.

10
00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.610
They keep me busy!

11
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:43.270
What do you like to do in your free time?

12
00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:47.230
I love painting and going for walks in the park.

13
00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.760
How about you?

14
00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.920
That sounds nice!

15
00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:56.710
I really enjoy reading and watching movies.

16
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.100
Do you have a car?

17
00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:03.040
No, I don’t.

18
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.980
I usually ride my bike or take the bus.

19
00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:08.800
It’s easier for me.

20
00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.130
That makes sense!

21
00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.330
Do you have any big dreams for the future?

22
00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:21.330
Hmm, I’d love to travel more and see different countries.

23
00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:23.590
How about you?

24
00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:29.410
I want to open a small coffee shop one day.

25
00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:32.740
I love making coffee!

26
00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.870
That sounds amazing!

27
00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:38.880
What kind of music do you like?

28
00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.120
I enjoy pop music,

29
00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:44.440
especially artists like Taylor Swift.

30
00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.440
What about you?

31
00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:48.670
I like her too!

32
00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:52.320
I also enjoy listening to Bruno Mars.

33
00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.490
Great choice!

34
00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:58.650
Maybe we can go to a concert together someday.

35
00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.410
I’d like that!
